</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 3: KP3 + PRACTICE ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：餘數小數點定位 — 「世紀災難」專項<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">SSPA 終極陷阱</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>核心規則（極易出錯！）：</strong><br/>
      同步移位後，<strong>餘數的小數點 = 被除數<u>原來的</u>小數點位置</strong><br/>
<br/>
      例：1.5 ÷ 0.4 → 同步 × 10 → 15 ÷ 40<br/>
      15 ÷ 40 = 0 餘 15（但這是移位後的餘數！）<br/>
<strong>還原：</strong>餘數 15 要 ÷ 10 → 真正的餘數是 <strong>1.5</strong><br/>
<br/>
      或以直式直接計算：1.5 ÷ 0.4 = 3 餘 0.3<br/>
<strong>驗算：</strong>0.4 × 3 + 0.3 = 1.2 + 0.3 = 1.5 ✓
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">世紀災難例題</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">例5：2.3 ÷ 0.6 = ？（求商和餘數）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">世紀災難（85% 學生錯）</div><div class="eq">2.3 ÷ 0.6 = 3 餘 5</div><div class="why">同步 × 10 後 23 ÷ 6 = 3 餘 5，忘記餘數要 ÷ 10 還原！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">正確答案</div><div class="eq">2.3 ÷ 0.6 = 3 餘 0.5</div><div class="why">驗算：0.6 × 3 + 0.5 = 1.8 + 0.5 = 2.3 ✓</div>

<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例6：3.7 ÷ 0.8 = ？（求商和餘數）</div></div>
<div class="mn">口訣：「移位計完要還原，餘數跟返原小數點；驗算乘除加餘數，唔驗算實出事」</div>
<div class="warn">世紀災難：同步移位後餘數忘記還原！移位時 ×10/×100，餘數必須 ÷10/÷100 還原！</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點三 同步練習（每題求商和餘數，必須驗算）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
